uy wasn't even a member of  the house he was a member of the senate  the guys always stirring up trouble with  with some of the knuckleheads in my  caucus  you know 210 of my republican colleagues  were great members  uh great to work with but there were 20  or 30 of them  uh there were they weren't conservative  hell i'm a conservative republican  they were knuckleheads and ted cruz came  over and kept  winding them up uh to to do crazy things  that have never had a chance of becoming  law all they were gonna do  is cause problems and uh and so uh  over the years i've just decided screw  intent crews  well today he tweeted out and i know  it's been going back and forth but today  he tweeted out some smart ass dropped  off a copy of boehner's new book at my  office  it's even signed i filed it in the  appropriate  place showing a picture of the fireplace  so i guess this is going to go back and  forth  i want to end with this pope francis  visited you in 2015  on capitol hill uh and you were seemed  touched by this visit  very touched and in his speech the pope  said another  temptation which we must especially  guard against the simplistic  reductionism  which sees only good or evil or if you  will the righteous  and the sinners i guess this book is  filled with ripping on a lot of people  mr speaker including ted cruz in one  interview you called him lucifer  incarnate um  is that what the pope was talking about  listen uh  i'm pretty good to most people in the  book that ted cruz gets the worst of it  now there are a few other people i nudge  but uh listen  i've had a really interesting life a  very interesting career  uh i've decided you know i think i'll  write a book  i think people might find this  interesting it was a great exercise i'm  glad i did it  and for for those who i've stepped under  toes for a little bit  it's okay it doesn't cost anything i  tell you what it is  it is an interesting read uh mr speaker  we appreciate your time  uh and uh enjoy the sunshine down there  in florida  thanks brett

